# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung für die neueste Version von Qiskit Bosons"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page explains how to install the Python API. A C API is not available for this package yet.\n"
msgstr "Diese Seite erklärt, wie du die Python-API installierst. Eine C-API ist für dieses Paket noch nicht verfügbar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Voraussetzungen {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Erstelle zunächst eine minimale Umgebung, in der nur Python installiert ist. Verwende dafür [virtuelle Python-Umgebungen](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere deine neue Umgebung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Es gibt zwei Hauptwege, dieses Paket zu installieren: von PyPI oder aus dem Quellcode. Die bevorzugte Methode ist die Installation von PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Von PyPI installieren {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Aus dem Quellcode installieren {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du im Repository entwickeln möchtest, solltest du aus dem Quellcode installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-bosons` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Zuerst muss Qiskit in derselben Python-Umgebung installiert sein, in der du `qiskit-bosons` installierst. Am einfachsten geht das über PyPI, du kannst Qiskit aber auch aus dem Quellcode installieren, wenn du möchtest.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-bosons` repository.\n"
msgstr "Klone als Nächstes das Repository `qiskit-bosons`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Installiere nun die Rust-Toolchain, aktualisiere pip und wechsle in das Repository. Anleitungen zur Installation der Toolchain findest du in der [Rust-Dokumentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Installiere die übrigen `build`-Abhängigkeiten. Wenn du im Repository entwickeln möchtest, installiere die `dev`-Abhängigkeiten.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-bosons` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Der nächste Schritt ist, `qiskit-bosons` in die virtuelle Umgebung zu installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hinweis\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Du kannst auch eine editierbare Installation durchführen und dabei das zugrunde liegende Rust-Crate weiterhin im `release`-Modus kompilieren:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Einige Funktionen beruhen auf optionalen Abhängigkeiten. Um alle zu installieren, verwende das Extra `all`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Im Abschnitt `[project.optional-dependencies]` von [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) siehst du, welche Abhängigkeitsgruppen verfügbar sind.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-bosons` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Du kannst optional prüfen, ob die Installation erfolgreich war. Der einfachste Test ist, eine der vom Paket `qiskit-bosons` bereitgestellten Klassen zu importieren, wie im folgenden Beispiel:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Wenn das erfolgreich durchläuft, hat deine Installation funktioniert.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Du kannst auch die gesamte Python-Testsuite ausführen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Um zusätzlich die Tests auszuführen, die optionale Abhängigkeiten beanspruchen, installiere die Extras und verwende das Target `testoptional`:\n"
